cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Hephaestus in your research, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: Hephaestus
abstract: >-
  Hephaestus is an open-source AI mentor for software teams. It checks developers' existing work
  in GitHub, GitLab, Slack and Outline against the engineering practices that their project values.
authors:
  - name: TUM Applied Education Technologies
    website: https://aet.cit.tum.de/
repository-code: https://github.com/hephaestus-build/Hephaestus
url: https://hephaestus.build
license: MIT
keywords:
  - ai-mentor
  - code-review
  - education
  - engineering-practices
  - developer-feedback
